ido e eficiente para diagnóstico, correção de falhas e resolução de problemas em computadores, notebooks e equipamentos de TI.</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-lg-{{columns}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImage\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/ic-manutencao-192x156.png\" alt=\"DATADARK\" data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Manutenção Preventiva</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">Evite paradas inesperadas através de revisões periódicas, limpeza, otimização e monitoramento dos equipamentos.</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-lg-{{columns}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImage\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/ic-servidores-192x106.png\" alt=\"DATADARK\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\" data-slide-to=\"2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Servidores Linux/Windows</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">Implantação, configuração e administração de servidores Linux e Windows para serviços corporativos, compartilhamentos, aplicações e segurança.</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-without-image 